    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">This transaction represents the vesting on November 4, 2026, of 33,333 Restricted Stock Units (&quot;RSUs&quot;) granted on November 4, 2025, under the Company's 2021 Equity Incentive Plan (as amended and restated on April 22, 2024) and reported on the Form 4 filed November 25, 2025. This relates to the vesting of the first of three equal annual installments (further details in Note 4 below). Each RSU represents the right to receive one share of Common Stock. These 33,333 RSUs were settled in shares of Common Stock on November 4, 2026.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">This transaction represents 8,117 shares of Common Stock withheld for tax obligations in connection with the settlement of November 4, 2026, of 33,333 RSUs that vested on November 4, 2026 (the first of three annual installments). The vesting of those 33,333 RSUs is described in Note 1.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">The 87,499 shares of Common Stock beneficially owned following the reported transaction reflects: (i) 33,333 shares acquired upon vesting of RSUs on November 4, 2026 (Note 1 above); less (ii) 8,117 shares withheld for tax upon settlement of RSUs on November 4, 2026 (Note 2 above).</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">The RSUs reported on the Form 4 filed November 25, 2025, were granted for a total of 100,000 RSUs vesting in three equal annual installments: one-third vested on November 4, 2026; one-third will vest on November 4, 2027; and the remaining one-third will vest on November 4, 2028. Following the vesting and settlement of the first installment reported herein, 66,667 RSUs remain outstanding.</footnote>
    </footnotes>

